  "_readme": [
    "Difficulty + theme tags for the Pictures-list filters. Keyed by puzzle id.",
    "  difficulty  chunky | normal | detailed | insane  (how the picture was built)",
    "  themes      1-3 of: Abstract, Animals, Fantasy, Flowers, Food, Landscape, Space, Spooky, Water",
    "Source of truth: tools/apply-tags.mjs reads this and writes difficulty/themes",
    "into puzzles/manifest.json (the list reads the manifest, not the puzzle JSON).",
    "Missing id defaults to difficulty \"normal\", no themes. Underscore keys ignored."
